  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1403.01 Factor of Safety",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1403.01 Factor of Safety.\n\n(a) All repairs of carnival or amusement rides, except as set forth in (b) below, shall be made and completed in a manner that follows the manufacturer’s specifications. The owner or operator shall be responsible for proper completion of repairs.\n\n(b) All repairs of challenge courses or zip lines shall conform to the standards set forth in either the “ANSI/ACCT 03-2019 CHALLENGE COURSES AND CANOPY/ZIP LINE TOURS STANDARDS” (Revision of ANSI/ACCT 03-2016 Standards) or in the ASTM International Standards listed in Saf-C 1402.01(a), available as noted in Appendix B.\n\n(c) The requirement in (a) above shall pertain to all aspects of each carnival or amusement ride including but not limited to, all of the following:\n\n(1) Structure;\n\n(2) Controls;\n\n(3) Power supplies;\n\n(4) Power conversion;\n\n(5) Governors;\n\n(6) Speed limiters;\n\n(7) Signal systems;\n\n(8) Restraining devices;\n\n(9) Braking;\n\n(10) Anti-roll-back devices; and\n\n(11) Supporting structures.\n\nSource. #2229, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2950, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4321, eff 10-6-87; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95; amd by #7618, eff 12-28-01; amd by #7833, INTERIM, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 8-21-03\n\nNew. #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14; ss by #12615, eff 8-28-18; ss by #13666, eff 6-20-23; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
